%% FIG-031 — Document indexing pipeline (section 17.3)
flowchart LR
  A[Trusted Reference] --> B{Valid content?}
  B -- no --> U[Indexing: Unavailable]
  B -- yes --> C[Extract text<br/>pages, paragraphs]
  C --> D[Extract metadata<br/>compare with Reference]
  D --> E[Chunk with stable IDs<br/>and locations]
  E --> F[Embed chunks<br/>record model + version]
  F --> G[(Vector DB<br/>accountId, referenceId, chunkId)]
  G --> H[Indexing: Indexed]
  C -- error --> X[Indexing: Failed + reason]
  F -- error --> X
